    "name": "Fresh Sweet Onion",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Fresh sweet onions are characterized by their&nbsp;mild, sweet flavor and relatively low pungency compared to other onion varieties.&nbsp;They are often larger than yellow onions and have a flatter, rounder shape.&nbsp;Their thin, papery skin can be yellow or light brown, and the flesh inside is translucent, juicy, and crisp.&nbsp;These onions are great for raw consumption in salads, sandwiches, and relishes, and also excel when cooked, especially in dishes requiring caramelization or onion rings.&nbsp;</span></p>",
